[139.754224, "o", "diately after the authenticated bookmark was created. The final bookmark be"]
[139.754256, "o", "came `crawlStatus: failure`, unlike the successful public-page control. The decisive dis"]
[139.754282, "o", "tinction is that processing f"]
[139.754306, "o", "ollowed a response-controlled destination from an allowed public origin to the protected internal hostname. A crawler can successfully make the unauthorized internal request even when the resulting document is unsuitable "]
[139.754347, "o", "for bookmark extraction or returns an"]
[139.75438, "o", " application status that causes the overall crawl to be marked failed.\r\n\r\nI also investigated the origin's sta\u001b[?2004h> "]
[139.754452, "o", "## Scope and surface mapped\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
